    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY. DESTRUCTIBLE. TRACK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your missiles to carve new paths through any wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bombs to blow holes in the track, making it harder for your opponents....and you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.poster.avif?t=1749585114\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.webm?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.mp4?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTI-PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 12 friends can race, destroy, and obliterate to place 1st</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the self-destruct timer, finding and optimizing your own paths of ruin is the only way to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or destroy the shortcuts created</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your  skills better at racing around the track naturally?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create even tighter corners to take around the race track, or just blast your way right through the middle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.poster.avif?t=1749585114\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.webm?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.mp4?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tracks to race on, destroy, as well as create and discover new paths to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various track sizes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smaller tracks with higher levels of chaos and destruction, for more arena combat style gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger / longer tracks for more racing style gameplay</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins while racing, these coins can be used in the shop to purchase customizations for your vehicle</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY. DESTRUCTIBLE. TRACK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your missiles to carve new paths through any wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bombs to blow holes in the track, making it harder for your opponents....and you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.poster.avif?t=1749585114\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.webm?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/6ec2c783c3c72c38f80c076e2f93d260.mp4?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTI-PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 12 friends can race, destroy, and obliterate to place 1st</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the self-destruct timer, finding and optimizing your own paths of ruin is the only way to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or destroy the shortcuts created</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your  skills better at racing around the track naturally?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create even tighter corners to take around the race track, or just blast your way right through the middle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.poster.avif?t=1749585114\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.webm?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/7868a82d8bdf91d6020bcfc21e8331c8.mp4?t=1749585114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tracks to race on, destroy, as well as create and discover new paths to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various track sizes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smaller tracks with higher levels of chaos and destruction, for more arena combat style gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger / longer tracks for more racing style gameplay</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins while racing, these coins can be used in the shop to purchase customizations for your vehicle</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A racing game with a FULLY. DESTRUCTIBLE. TRACK. Blast through any wall to forge new paths to 1st. Obliterate the very ground of the track to make it more difficult for your opponents, and yourself if you can handle it.",
